OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FStorm Austen
OL,6,Fpushes northeastwards bringing
OL,7,Fwidespread rain with some heavy bursts
OL,8,Fovernight. Windy for a time during the
OL,9,Fearly hours the easing briefly towards
OL,10,Fdawn.
OL,11,
OL,12,CFriday:FOutbreaks of heavy and
OL,13,Fpersistent rain continue to move
OL,14,Fnortheastwards through the day. Winds
OL,15,Fquickly picking up through the morning.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
